	"details": "",
	"flavor": "NSLOCTEXT(\"[D20C99C24B2FABB4DC05E3BF1EE067C5]\", \"1AF995E54909CD843B0F32BCF812652B\", \"Sinew and spirit in perfect rhythm, the Horse has long been the companion of warriors, wanderers, and kings. Its hooves drum like distant thunder across plains and stone, carrying its rider with speed, grace, and silent resolve. Though lacking the horns or claws of more fearsome beasts, few mounts rival its endurance or loyalty. Muscles ripple beneath a coat of wind-washed hair, and eyes gleam with quiet intelligence, ever alert to threat and command alike. It is not shaped by magic, but by trust and time, and in that lies its power.\")",
